abstract: >-
  Code and supporting materials for unsupervised SAR oil-spill anomaly detection
  using Variational Autoencoders and Adversarial Autoencoders across the MV
  Wakashio and DARTIS-2019 datasets.
keywords:
  - synthetic aperture radar
  - SAR
  - oil spill detection
  - anomaly detection
  - variational autoencoder
  - adversarial autoencoder
  - remote sensing
  - DARTIS-2019
  - MV Wakashio
